WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.033 --> 00:00:02.033
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to

00:00:02.033 --> 00:00:03.267
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.267 --> 00:00:04.767
Thank you for being here.
Thank you for watching.

00:00:04.767 --> 00:00:07.100
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:10.968
Well, guys, after teasing
a name change for a while, now,

00:00:10.968 --> 00:00:13.634
today Mark Zuckerberg
finally revealed

00:00:13.634 --> 00:00:16.667
the new name of Facebook.
Here it is.

00:00:16.667 --> 00:00:18.567
-To reflect who we are

00:00:18.567 --> 00:00:20.567
and what we hope to build,

00:00:20.567 --> 00:00:23.467
I am proud to announce that,
starting today,

00:00:23.467 --> 00:00:26.701
our company is now...

00:00:26.701 --> 00:00:29.701
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.067 --> 00:00:34.434
-What?
-Yeah.

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:36.334
-Meta?
-Meta.

00:00:36.334 --> 00:00:37.334
-What?
-Yeah.

00:00:37.334 --> 00:00:39.567
Meta, as in,
"When I joined Facebook,

00:00:39.567 --> 00:00:40.934
I Meta [met a] lot
of crazy people."

00:00:40.934 --> 00:00:42.033
[ Laughter and applause ]
-Hey!
-Thank you.

00:00:42.033 --> 00:00:43.634
[ Rimshot ]

00:00:43.634 --> 00:00:45.167
-Yeah!

00:00:45.167 --> 00:00:47.501
Wow, baby!

00:00:47.501 --> 00:00:49.901
-Yeah, Facebook
changed their name

00:00:49.901 --> 00:00:51.400
and the response spectrum
was like --

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:52.767
[ Smoker's gravelly voice ]
We used to be TimeWarner

00:00:52.767 --> 00:00:53.834
and people still hate us.

00:00:53.834 --> 00:00:56.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:56.601 --> 00:00:59.000
This feels like
when there's an E. coli outbreak

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.701
at a pizza place
and they just change the name

00:01:00.701 --> 00:01:02.901
from Sal &amp; Tony's
to Tony &amp; Sal's.

00:01:02.901 --> 00:01:06.033
[ Laughter ]
Same grass owners, yeah.

00:01:06.033 --> 00:01:07.400
Companies often
change their name

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.234
to help their image
and, since it's up for grabs,

00:01:09.234 --> 00:01:10.400
Johnson &amp; Johnson is now

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:11.467
Facebook &amp; Facebook.

00:01:11.467 --> 00:01:12.767
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:12.767 --> 00:01:14.133
They'll take it.

00:01:14.133 --> 00:01:16.067
Meta.

00:01:16.067 --> 00:01:17.601
Yeah, Meta.
Apparently, they're trying

00:01:17.601 --> 00:01:19.200
to win back younger users.

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:21.133
They even released a new ad

00:01:21.133 --> 00:01:23.467
and it seems like they're trying
a little too hard

00:01:23.467 --> 00:01:25.334
to get to young --
You be the judge.

00:01:25.334 --> 00:01:26.434
-What up, fam?!

00:01:26.434 --> 00:01:28.501
You want a dope
social media network

00:01:28.501 --> 00:01:29.934
that's so snatched?!

00:01:29.934 --> 00:01:31.300
Then join Facebook.

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:33.167
-F-F-F-Facebook!

00:01:35.734 --> 00:01:38.334
-We're totally bussin'
with Russian memes.

00:01:39.367 --> 00:01:41.701
And we got a hella fire CEO.

00:01:43.434 --> 00:01:44.934
[ Roars ]

00:01:44.934 --> 00:01:45.934
We're not cheugy.

00:01:45.934 --> 00:01:46.934
We're the GOAT.

00:01:46.934 --> 00:01:47.934
-[ Screeching ]

00:01:49.601 --> 00:01:50.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:50.601 --> 00:01:53.801
[ Cheering ]

00:01:53.801 --> 00:01:55.734
-Wow!

00:01:55.734 --> 00:01:56.801
-"What up, fam?!"

00:01:56.801 --> 00:01:59.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.467 --> 00:02:02.934
Some news
from the White House --

00:02:02.934 --> 00:02:05.367
coming off some of his lowest
approval rating numbers,

00:02:05.367 --> 00:02:07.167
today President Biden left
for Europe

00:02:07.167 --> 00:02:08.834
and his first stop is in Rome,

00:02:08.834 --> 00:02:11.000
where he's going to meet
with Pope Francis.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:12.601
Now, however,
the Vatican just canceled

00:02:12.601 --> 00:02:15.567
the live broadcast
of the two of them meeting.

00:02:15.567 --> 00:02:17.234
Not a great time for Biden,
when the Pope is like,

00:02:17.234 --> 00:02:18.667
"I can't be seen with you
right now."

00:02:18.667 --> 00:02:20.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.300 --> 00:02:22.667
Meanwhile, since Biden is going
to be out of town for Halloween,

00:02:22.667 --> 00:02:24.400
the White House
will not be holding

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:26.334
its usual
trick-or-treating event.

00:02:26.334 --> 00:02:27.834
[ Audience awws ]

00:02:27.834 --> 00:02:30.767
Smart move, though, to announce
to the entire country

00:02:30.767 --> 00:02:32.501
that you're going to be
out of town on Halloween.

00:02:32.501 --> 00:02:34.000
[ Laughter ]
"How far do you think

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:36.667
I can throw this egg?
Hit the West Wing

00:02:36.667 --> 00:02:38.267
from here, you think?"
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.267 --> 00:02:39.634
If there's another
toilet paper shortage,

00:02:39.634 --> 00:02:41.734
you can find it in all the trees
around the White House.

00:02:41.734 --> 00:02:42.934
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.934 --> 00:02:45.000
Biden actually wanted
to do trick-or-treating,

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.200
but Joe Manchin blocked it

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:47.701
because he hates
government handouts.

00:02:47.701 --> 00:02:51.000
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.067
[ Cheering ]
-Come on!

00:02:52.067 --> 00:02:53.467
[ Rimshot ]

00:02:53.467 --> 00:02:54.901
Come on!
-That's right,

00:02:54.901 --> 00:02:56.267
no Halloween at the White House,

00:02:56.267 --> 00:02:58.601
meanwhile, one very
nervous bird was like,

00:02:58.601 --> 00:03:00.601
"He's still doing the turkey
pardoning next month, right?

00:03:00.601 --> 00:03:03.300
[ Laughter ]
Hi, I'm Giblet, by the way."

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:05.601
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.601 --> 00:03:06.868
"I'm Wishbone, yeah.

00:03:06.868 --> 00:03:08.834
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.834 --> 00:03:11.567
In a couple weeks,
it's going to be like

00:03:11.567 --> 00:03:13.634
Red Light, Green Light
with us, so."

00:03:13.634 --> 00:03:16.300
[ Laughter ]

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:17.968
Did you guys see this?
While talking to reporters,

00:03:17.968 --> 00:03:19.767
Senator Bernie Sanders
was interrupted

00:03:19.767 --> 00:03:21.167
by a phone call
and people were talking

00:03:21.167 --> 00:03:24.100
about his loud ringtone.
Listen to this.

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:25.300
-So you're not onboard with this

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:26.701
framework, as it's now drafted?

00:03:26.701 --> 00:03:27.834
[ Ring ]
-I want to see the language.

00:03:27.901 --> 00:03:31.634
[ Ring ]
I want to see it improved.

00:03:31.701 --> 00:03:34.534
[ Ring ]
And again, I think it --
you know.

00:03:34.534 --> 00:03:36.234
[ Laughter ]
Yeah, that's actually

00:03:36.234 --> 00:03:37.434
not an old-timey ringtone.

00:03:37.434 --> 00:03:39.367
He actually has a rotary phone
in his pocket.

00:03:39.367 --> 00:03:41.200
[ Laughter and applause ]
[ As Sanders ] I can only go

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:44.100
60 feet from my house
before the --

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:47.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:47.501 --> 00:03:49.601
Then, he picked up the phone
by putting a horn in his ear.

00:03:49.601 --> 00:03:51.400
[ As Sanders ]
Hello! What?!

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:53.367
[ Laughter ]

00:03:53.367 --> 00:03:55.334
Hey, this is cool --
Delta Airlines

00:03:55.334 --> 00:03:58.000
is launching a new program
that will use facial recognition

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.501
for passengers going
through TSA.

00:04:00.501 --> 00:04:02.067
It's all part
of Delta's brilliant plan

00:04:02.067 --> 00:04:04.200
to get people to take
their masks off at the airport.

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:08.801
[ Laughter ]

00:04:08.801 --> 00:04:10.801
They actually had the same
facial recognition program

00:04:10.801 --> 00:04:13.467
before you board a plane
on Southwest Airlines.
Check this out.

00:04:13.467 --> 00:04:15.267
-[ Speaking Korean ]

00:04:15.267 --> 00:04:16.701
[ Laughter and applause ]
-Yeah.

00:04:16.701 --> 00:04:19.501
Yeah, they don't mess around
on Southwest, yeah.

00:04:19.501 --> 00:04:21.000
[ Applause ]
They don't mess around.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:24.601
[ Cheering ]

00:04:24.601 --> 00:04:27.067
Some more travel news.

00:04:27.067 --> 00:04:28.267
This is real.

00:04:28.267 --> 00:04:30.367
United Airlines just announced
that, next month,

00:04:30.367 --> 00:04:31.567
it will begin selling

00:04:31.567 --> 00:04:34.033
mini bottles of hard liquor
on flights.

00:04:34.033 --> 00:04:37.901
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:04:37.901 --> 00:04:40.467
Yeah, the move is all part
of the company's new slogan...

00:04:42.868 --> 00:04:46.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:46.934 --> 00:04:48.834
-Wow!
-[ Slurring ] I'll just have

00:04:48.834 --> 00:04:50.167
one more.
I'll just have one more.

00:04:50.167 --> 00:04:52.234
[ Laughter ]

00:04:52.234 --> 00:04:55.334
Hey, I saw that
a futuristic robot dog

00:04:55.334 --> 00:04:56.534
was just spotted walking

00:04:56.534 --> 00:04:58.968
down 6th Avenue here
in New York City.

00:04:58.968 --> 00:05:00.133
Watch this video, yeah.

00:05:04.534 --> 00:05:05.534
-[ Barks ]

00:05:08.334 --> 00:05:11.100
-Yeah. Even crazier, there was
another robot walking behind it

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:12.167
with a little plastic bag.

00:05:12.167 --> 00:05:15.534
[ Laughter ]
-Oh.

00:05:15.534 --> 00:05:16.901
-I love how New Yorkers
walked by

00:05:16.901 --> 00:05:18.567
like nothing was happening,
like, "Oh, yeah."

00:05:18.567 --> 00:05:21.601
[ Laughter ]
The robot was like --

00:05:21.601 --> 00:05:23.234
[ As Schwarzenegger ]
I'm a cybernetic organism sent

00:05:23.234 --> 00:05:25.701
from the future
to pee on fire hydrants.

00:05:25.701 --> 00:05:28.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:28.467 --> 00:05:30.200
They're like, "Oh, that?
That's normal. No big deal."

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:32.601
[ Laughter ]
And, finally, this isn't good --

00:05:32.601 --> 00:05:36.067
a new study shows small amounts
of plastic are found

00:05:36.067 --> 00:05:38.501
in the food from chains
like McDonald's.

00:05:38.501 --> 00:05:40.701
[ Murmuring ]
You can tell things are bad
at McDonald's.

00:05:40.701 --> 00:05:42.367
Today, they changed their name
to McMeta.

00:05:42.367 --> 00:05:43.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

